184
00:15:27.343 --> 00:15:31.388
<i>This leukemia therapy
was a long shot, Sean.</i>

185
00:15:31.514 --> 00:15:32.957
<i>It was working.</i>

186
00:15:33.682 --> 00:15:37.394
<i>The balance between the red
and white cells had restored.</i>

187
00:15:37.520 --> 00:15:38.963
However, not anymore.

188
00:15:40.856 --> 00:15:41.909
<i>I am sorry.</i>

189
00:15:46.320 --> 00:15:47.322
