221
00:19:48.854 --> 00:19:49.993
Okay.

222
00:19:51.148 --> 00:19:53.819
- We are going to fight all the way.
- Yes.

223
00:20:17.299 --> 00:20:18.301
<i>Faith?</i>

224
00:20:19.427 --> 00:20:20.512
Coach?

225
00:20:21.637 --> 00:20:22.806
